cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Ligation Calculator"
message: "If you use this tool in published work, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Afkaar"
    given-names: "Shafiq"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ShafiqAfkaar/ligation-calculator"
url: "https://shafiqafkaar.github.io/ligation-calculator/"
abstract: >-
  A dependency-free, single-file browser calculator for setting up ligation,
  Gibson assembly and homologous-recombination cloning reactions. Converts
  vector and insert concentrations, lengths and a target molar ratio into
  pipetting volumes, and flags volumes below the accurate range of an
  air-displacement pipette.
keywords:
  - molecular-cloning
  - ligation
  - gibson-assembly
  - homologous-recombination
  - molecular-biology
  - laboratory-tools
license: MIT
